  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog\n\n## 2.0.0\n\n### Added\n\n- Added support for data records\n- Added support for callbacks\n\n### Changed\n\n- Package name updated to `Gclib` from `gclib-dotnet`. View the [original package](..), which is compatible with `gclib` versions earlier than `2.4.0`.\n- Wrapper has been updated to use the new C APIs added in gclib 2.4.0\n- API has been reorganized to match the new C++ wrapper\n- Minimum supported gclib raised to 2.4.0\n\n## 1.0.0\n\n### Changed\n\n- Packaged C# wrapper separately from gclib as [`gclib-dotnet`](..)",
